OL,3,GNEWSAMixed feelings from consumers as
OL,4,Aelectricity discount to be given to NI
OL,5,Ahouseholds
OL,6,
OL,7,FA one-off electricity bill reduction
OL,8,Fwill "make a difference" to some while
OL,9,Fothers believe it is "nothing in
OL,10,Fcomparison" to price rises.
OL,12,FHouseholds across Northern Ireland will
OL,13,Fget the one-off #63 reduction in
OL,14,Felectricity bills from next month and
OL,15,Fit will be applied automatically
OL,16,Fwithout the need for an application.
OL,18,FSpeaking to BBC News NI in Belfast city
OL,19,Fcentre, Alison said the discount
OL,20,F"wouldn't make a lot of difference over
OL,21,Fthe course of a year".
